    <main>
      <nav><a href="/">Bible Orbit</a></nav>
      <section class="support">
        <div class="eyebrow">Support</div>
        <h1>Bible Orbit Support</h1>

        <p>
          Bible Orbit support is available for app help, account questions, privacy
          questions, and account or data deletion requests.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <p>
            <strong>Contact:</strong>
            <a href="mailto:support@bibleorbit.org">support@bibleorbit.org</a>
          </p>
          <p>
            Please include the email address used for your Bible Orbit profile and a
            brief description of the issue or request.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2>What We Can Help With</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Sign-in or profile access issues.</li>
          <li>Reading progress, completion history, audio playback, or group sync questions.</li>
          <li>Orbit group invitation and participation questions.</li>
          <li>Privacy questions related to your Bible Orbit profile.</li>
          <li>Account deletion or associated data deletion requests.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Account and Data Deletion</h2>
        <p>
          To request deletion of your Bible Orbit account or associated profile data,
          email <a href="mailto:support@bibleorbit.org">support@bibleorbit.org</a>
          from the email address connected to your profile when possible. If you are
          writing from another address, include enough information for us to identify
          the profile you want reviewed.
        </p>

        <h2>Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Bible Orbit uses profile and reading progress data to support Scripture
          reading, progress tracking, and Orbit group features. Review the Privacy
          Policy for more detail about what is collected and how it is used.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="mailto:support@bibleorbit.org">Email Support</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
